      "message": "Not needed for this CL, but I don\u0027t see this in the BEP version. Looks like it\u0027s doing:\n\n```\n\terrors |\u003d fpc_check_hwid();\n```\n\nI didn\u0027t look to see if that would affect any other call sites, but maybe we can do the same thing.",
